Z||000000||Slammed Fiero||01-29-2001||02:28 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/decisions.jpg"> <P>Just sitting here ..bored...Thought this was a cool pic. Taken at about 6:30 in the morning before heading to Shannonville Motorsport park for a day of lapping. , In the background my dads 94 911 RS America , 3.8ltr ,lowered , headers , TWM induction all the goodies ..yummy... and my fiero , 2.8ltr in need of valve seals... But fun none the less.<P>talking to a friend who just finished his 93 300ZX TT complete rebuild , he is having traction problems right to 3rd gear , and he hasn't even redlined the car yet. I want traction problems....<P><BR>Fierolisa Just left a few hours ago.... Life is back to normal<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jonathan M McCreery<BR>86 GT<BR>New Custom White face gauges 17" Tr motorsports Typhoons Ground Control coil overs , Big bars front and rear , Mustang scoop , accel coil , no cat , 4spd , short shift , poly dog bone and bushings momo pedals and shift knob , round headlight conversion , Geni stainless steel oval exhaust tips. Pioneer 6000 CD player , Sony Mobile Amp. Currently doing big brake conversion...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/jssig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
