Z||000014||Eric||01-29-2001||10:52 PM||||Porsches are great for getting airborne.  I grew up across the street from an Indy car driver who is into Porsche restoration.  You haven't lived unless you've riden shotgun in a half restored 911 driven by an Indy car driver while sitting on a milkcrate.  Needless to say, the front tires pulled off the ground several times.  I should have logged the time in my pilot's logbook. <P>There's a guy in my SCCA club who drives a vw golf.  It's all race prepped and, I swear, he has the inside rear tire off the ground six inches for the majority of his run.  It's an awesome thing to see.||||reg||14
