Z||000017||rogergarrison||01-30-2001||07:50 AM||||Ill post it when I find out when it is for sure. A good friend who used to do all the work on my SL races one in SCCA. Hell let me know. Maybe Lisa would like to try out her GT too. There is an Porsche (used only) dealer on Powell road in the industrial park across the street from speedway. He may know when the tracks open too. I think the Porsche club occasionaly uses it too.||||reg||1
